# Copy/adapt to `public/_redirects` for Cloudflare Pages same-origin API proxy.
# Replace BACKEND_ORIGIN with the Railway HTTPS host (no scheme path suffix).
# Example destination: https://quoteflow-staging.up.railway.app
#
# /api/*  https://BACKEND_ORIGIN/api/:splat  200
# /*      /index.html   200
#
# Keep /api above the SPA catch-all. Do not commit a production secret host by accident;
# staging hostnames are OK if non-sensitive.
